 LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">일학습병행제</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">기업이 청년 등을 선채용 후 체계적 현장훈련을 실시하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학교</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">공동훈련센터의 보완적 이론교육을 통해 직무역량을 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">기르는 일터 기반 학습</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><strong><span styl